WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.707
The inner query groups admissions by patient ID That
creates one

00:00:05.733 --> 00:00:11.275
admission-count row per patient ID The outer query
left joins those

00:00:11.288 --> 00:00:16.924
counts to the patient table COALESCE converts
missing counts to zero for

00:00:16.950 --> 00:00:22.767
patients with no admissions This pattern makes the
intermediate grain very

00:00:22.794 --> 00:00:23.280
clear
